## TEMPLATE-FIRST APPROACH (MANDATORY)

**Before generating any specification:**
1. READ `examples/` folder for chosen format
2. MATCH example structure exactly
3. EXTERNALIZE all examples (never inline)
4. For RAML: USE `!include` | For OAS: USE `$ref`

> **Details**: See `@02-00_Template_Configuration.mdc`

